Now the network builder interfaces: restructure to a helper with stage branches. Current builder is a nested ternary. I'll refactor: extract `interfacesFor(stage, users)`:

```js
const CROWD = (snapshot) => `${snapshot.users} simulated browsers`;
function interfacesFor(stage, users) {
  const base = {
    10.1: stage >= 2 ? 'LoadBalancer' : 'WebServer',
    10.11: 'WebServer-1',
