Hmm — the numeric key 10.31 in original: JSON.stringify({10.31: ...}) → "10.31": ✓. 10.65 → "10.65" ✓ (10.65 exactly representable? 10.65 in float is 10.65 display — JS numbers stringify to shortest repr "10.65" ✓). 20.1 → "20.1" ✓.

